  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-95035cbb-2da3-4da4-a965-cecfa06a0833\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1820e7f0-5541-492f-ba6a-097e8bb7db63\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-11da956e-9c8e-4f9a-a6e3-9b870012b565\">지난 4일간 블로그 온라인 강의 30강을 찍느라 책의 표지를 넘겨보지도 못했다. 오늘 문득 깨달은 바가 있어서 이 곳에 &quot;마약 중독보다 무서운 &#x27;이것&#x27;&quot;이라는 주제로 글을 써보려 했는데 결과는 처참했다. 2시간째 쓰는 중이지만 쓴 글은 고작 10줄이다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-67690e35-a569-4a6e-9870-e1d8763d8131\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-48b4f1c1-7df2-418f-9ff6-ce9ca462b1cb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a3745fcb-4319-4893-bee3-e15ca8b8fdb0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-982a1681-cb43-4922-9c03-b9b863ac445e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-af5d680b-fa3e-4376-915e-35720cffd367\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f60d7022-0d2f-44ca-a573-edb396aa037c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8ebf4446-4bab-4721-82f0-d073d1bd8d9a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-217d7c18-0355-48e7-a2bd-9a4aeeb93a38\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4694c259-bf4f-4186-b0df-e9c70214cfa2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4d6d38ab-c8b4-4e7c-9552-3669891de22e\">역시 인풋(책읽기)이 없는 글쓰기는 뇌 없는 사람 같다. 주입식 독서모임 같은거라도 해야될까보다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0f605535-15a3-42a4-8d1a-b02a5684f964\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f9ad6005-dea2-4ade-b5ca-9f87ce686fe7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-490698f3-ef66-4c31-9ad4-aebb482e0253\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d50ae2c5-5ca2-4197-ab5e-a7773af10a42\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f5697eef-4867-4795-a5e0-5c0354c5f8ea\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-495c4301-ecaf-481c-ac61-24395cc730d7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-130a1889-b7a3-4d40-82ea-de9c5d206def\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-70737324-7816-44bd-8774-7b606a11329e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-62eeaf84-16be-4f85-b305-3a5dff4eef33\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-87f5235d-7c84-435f-ac36-9e54e300c7bf\">P.S. 챗 GPT 한테 물어봐도 하나도 도움이 안된다!!! 이런 애가 사람을 대체한다고??? 풉</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
